[{"client_msg_id":"e8cbddd5-5020-4877-9725-7e38e9a2a224","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"制作に参加したゲームが中古ゲームのお店に並んでいるのを見ると、いろいろ物思ってしまう。","ts":"1633144431.377600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e/6Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38b4d3ae-b042-4f6e-9fba-6e29432bfafa","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"護石じゃないな、スロットにスキルつけるやつの方（護石集めはそもそもやらなかった）","ts":"1633144295.377100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ChD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"740dbafa-d315-4df8-8998-126feac19183","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"2ndGからのライズ勢でしたけど相当楽に感じましたね。\n護石は露骨にレア素材要求されるんですけど、装備は2, 3回も倒せばそのモンスターの装備コンプできる\n（しかも一式揃える意味もそこまでない）という感じで、だいぶ緩くなったような","ts":"1633144243.376400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":2,"users":["U06BRP8VD","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H9ga"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b9e7937-84be-4b1d-a0f9-c5a19ae6b4dc","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"装備のための素材狙いの周回要素って、最近はかなり緩和されてるの?","ts":"1633143581.375200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RvKBN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fcb67e56-d4ad-46ae-8651-d2d547fb130c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"DLCじゃないけど、別チャレンジ枠であるくらいがいいのかな...(本編の負担を双方で減らす+やりこみ要素を増す)?","ts":"1633141120.374700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iw5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b904485-0feb-4d77-9db8-56239144de95","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あと亜種とかいう水増しの極みみたいのなかったんだ、ライズは\nでもないならないで寂しいっていう・・・","ts":"1633140621.373700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"rice","count":1,"users":["U03C4RC8X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P=//"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4c23971-cf3b-4539-a6ef-d70217f9831f","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ことモンハンに関しては水増し部分が好きだったんですけどね（装備集めとか）\n一応今作も護石ガチャとかあるけど、不思議と装備ほどモチベにはならなかったんだよなあ。\n装備集めを楽にして遊びやすくしたのは分かるので、納得はできる。","ts":"1633140153.373200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tx3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1be5bb98-773e-456f-914f-eb99c4fdc0bc","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"良い言い方をすると、本筋とは関係ないやりこみ要素が少なく、水増しがされていない。","ts":"1633138749.371500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xTx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb63bd26-6a3f-4e20-b217-26c3360044ba","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"カプコンのゲームって昔は常に値段相応のボリューム、言い換えるとフルプライスな割にあっさり終わるって言われてたよ。","ts":"1633138627.370900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rq2F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"950e81f5-ed88-4453-8502-98fa9a9d5925","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"考えさせられる話だ","ts":"1633124853.369700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IQK+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d5703a7-56da-48d3-ba5d-c3b6453eed28","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003chttps://youtu.be/r8S8xtUPj2A|https://youtu.be/r8S8xtUPj2A\u003e","ts":"1633124846.369300","attachments":[{"fallback":"YouTube Video: モンハンライズのボリューム、私は満足です【Nintendo Switch】","id":1,"author_name":"ユーキゲイムズ/Yuki-Games","author_link":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCr0mzBxcQh1-rUHCbA5zN3w","title":"モンハンライズのボリューム、私は満足です【Nintendo Switch】","title_link":"https://youtu.be/r8S8xtUPj2A","thumb_url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/r8S8xtUPj2A/hqdefault.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"YouTube","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/youtube.png","thumb_width":480,"thumb_height":360,"video_html":"\u003ciframe width=\"400\" height=\"225\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/r8S8xtUPj2A?feature=oembed\u0026autoplay=1\u0026iv_load